---
// Scene 7: Clarification
// Experience: Elegant rhythm, avoiding endless accordions.
// Visual: Question -> Short sharp answer -> Learn More link.
---

<section id="scene-clarification" class="relative bg-background border-t border-border py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-24 md:w-1/2">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6">
        TODO: Copy provided by ChatGPT
